## 기능 명세 : API 추가 및 수정

### 신규
- GET /api/v1/albums/{albumId}/markers

> 요청 바디 
```
public record AlbumPhotoMarkersRequest(
        @Min(0) @Max(90)
        double swLat,

        @Min(0) @Max(180)
        double swLng,

        @Min(0) @Max(90)
        double neLat,

        @Min(0) @Max(180)
        double neLng
) {
}
```

### 변경 
- GET /api/v1/albums/{albumId}/photos
    - pageable 있음

> 응답 바디
```
public record AlbumPhotoItemsResponse(
        List<InnerAlbumPhotoItem> items
) {
    public record InnerAlbumPhotoItem(
            Long id,
            Long photoId,
            String fileName,
            String filePath,
            String thumbnailPath,
            LocalDateTime capturedDt
    ) {
    }
}
```

- GET /api/v1/photos/markers?userId={userId}

> 요청 바디
```
public record PhotoMarkersRequest(
        @NotNull @Min(0)
        Long userId,

        @Min(0) @Max(90)
        double swLat,

        @Min(0) @Max(180)
        double swLng,

        @Min(0) @Max(90)
        double neLat,

        @Min(0) @Max(180)
        double neLng
) {
}
```
> 응답 바디
```
public record PhotoMarkersResponse(
        Integer count,
        List<InnerPhotoMarker> photoMarkers
) {
    public record InnerPhotoMarker(
            Long id,
            String filePath,
            String thumbnailPath,
            LocalDateTime capturedDt,
            Double lat,
            Double lng
    ) {
    }
}
```